  "description": "Inline line editor for header-detail forms in ASP.NET Core MVC (.NET 10). Columns are declared once in C#, an Alpine.js runtime edits cell by cell (text, number, date, select, remote lookup, toggle, computed), and the header form posts Lines[i].Field for native model binding: no changes to controllers or services. Per-cell ModelState errors, footer totals, keyboard navigation and spreadsheet paste. Assets are embedded; Alpine.js 3 is provided by the host.",
